@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Serif CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
hide empty description
state "接收中\n校验头部后可 RWW" as Receiving
state "提交中\n头片段最后写" as Committing
state "已提交\n完整记录可验证读取" as Readable
state "失败 / 失效\n不可新命中" as Invalid
state "仅旧响应可读\n禁止目录与位图发布" as Private
[*] --> Receiving : 取得写入所有权及 FillToken
Receiving --> Committing : 正文完整且校验通过
Receiving --> Invalid : 错误 / 取消 / 超时
Committing --> Readable : 写入完成且版本 / 所有权 / token 有效
Committing --> Invalid : 写失败或强制失效
Receiving --> Private : PURGE 撤销发布权
Committing --> Private : PURGE 撤销发布权
Readable --> Private : PURGE，仍持有正确旧字节
Readable --> Invalid : 替换 / 环形覆盖 / 损坏
Private --> Invalid : 上游 / 存储错误或取消
Private --> [*] : 旧响应完成
Invalid --> [*]
note right of Readable
  chunk 数据及目录先发布，再置 segment 完成位
  位图仅供规划，实际读取仍须校验
  可读提交不等于逐块 fsync
  已发送字节不能撤回
end note
@enduml
